# SYNTHETIC. Written from RFC 5321. Not a recording: phase-0 capture
# against a real server has not happened yet.
# The client will only do PLAIN. The server offers LOGIN, so no AUTH command
# is sent. The offered list stays on the session for the caller to read.

S: 220 smtp.example ESMTP ready
C: EHLO client.example
S: 250-smtp.example Hello
S: 250 AUTH LOGIN
FAIL Unsupported
